# DIAGNOSTICS

`CROI_ERR_BAD_HANDLE`, `CROI_ERR_WRONG_TYPE` and `CROI_ERR_ACCESS_DENIED` as for any handle; see syscall(2).
`CROI_ERR_BAD_STATE`: the address space is gone because its process died.

